ere's enough for more"},{"s":76.24,"e":79.12,"text":"From the corner to the church, from the book to the block"},{"s":79.12,"e":81.88,"text":"Slain love in the stew when the lid get knocked"},{"s":81.88,"e":84.4,"text":"If your hands are tired, if your back is sore"},{"s":84.38,"e":87.14,"text":"Bring that heavy day in, leave it at the door"},{"s":87.48,"e":92.86,"text":"Any kind of way you can come and eat"},{"s":92.86,"e":95.3,"text":"St. John's on the corner"},{"s":95.4,"e":99.5,"text":"Makin' sure you're complete, yeah"},{"s":99.7,"e":101.88,"text":"- Free meals comin', free meals comin'"},{"s":101.98,"e":105.04,"text":"- Chef Lou got the pot on fire, hey"},{"s":105.08,"e":107.36,"text":"- Free meals comin', free meals comin'"},{"s":107.38,"e":109.48,"text":"- St. John's keep the table wide"},{"s":109.56,"e":111.78,"text":"- Children of God"},{"s":111.78,"e":115.14,"text":"- We all get fed, yeah"},{"s":115.14,"e":117.26,"text":"- Children of God"},{"s":117.3,"e":119.26,"text":"- Come and break that bread"},{"s":120.26,"e":123.14,"text":"He learned how to serve with a holy heart"},{"s":123.14,"e":126.04,"text":"Take a little less, give a lot more stock"},{"s":126.04,"e":128.7,"text":"When the world get cold and the rent come due"},{"s":128.7,"e":131.98,"text":"Somebody still got love and that somebody's loose"},{"s":132.64,"e":134.92,"text":"- Free meals comin', free meals comin'"},{"s":134.98,"e":138.12,"text":"- Chef Lou got the pot on fire, hey"},{"s":138.14,"e":140.4,"text":"- Free meals comin', free meals comin'"},{"s":141,"e":142.58,"text":"- St. John's keep the table wide"},{"s":142.92,"e":144.7,"text":"- Children of God"},{"s":145.38,"e":148.32,"text":"- We all get fed, yeah"},{"s":148.32,"e":150.54,"text":"- Children of God"},{"s":150.54,"e":152.88,"text":"- Come and break that bread"},{"s":154.72,"e":158.36,"text":"- Free meals comin', free meals comin'"},{"s":158.38,"e":160.2,"text":"- That stew got the whole block"},{"s":160.24,"e":162.2,"text":"- Fre